{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中環怡和大廈外牆有吊船停止運作，2名工人被困外牆。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方6時許接報，指大廈外牆有吊船暫停運作，當時有2名工人在吊船上工作，他們身上有佩戴安全帶，被困外牆正等待救援，有救護車和消防車在場戒備。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.353914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:11:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:46.815685+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:27.004374+00:00","content_hash":"41f8822405265e027e85753e0167b5a789b1233a3844ef110296bc61934b7c41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}